#  tick "Text me when it's my turn" (default ON, under the phone field) was unticked, not when Settings -> Text messages -> "Text walk-ins when they're next"
#  (default ON, last of the automatic texts) is off, not to STOP numbers, never to appointments. The salon's own texting device (Android / SMS Server).
#  The Check-in list shows "texted 10:42". Turn rules are only READ (ta_state) - nothing in the turn line changes.
#  Files: cron/turn.php, inc/api/checkin.php, inc/turnq.php, inc/api/settings.php, assets/admin/settings-texts.js, assets/checkin.js, assets/checkin-2.js,
